# Line-ending policy for the Foundation repository.
#
# `instruction-manuals/` holds the DISTRIBUTED copies of the root master
# instruction manuals. They must stay byte-identical to
# `.project-instructions/deployment-info/instruction-manuals/` in the root
# governance repository and are verified with SHA-256 (procedure in that
# directory's README). Automatic line-ending conversion would silently break
# that contract on any machine with `core.autocrlf=true`, so the manuals are
# stored and checked out verbatim — no text conversion, ever.
#
# Edit the MASTER and re-propagate; never edit a distributed copy in place.
instruction-manuals/** -text
